# With special_inbox off, qi says there is no INBOX, yet the INBOX project can still be picked with /.
config <<END
special_inbox = false
END
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Old item
END
keys qi
status No INBOX project in the Navigator
hide Quick Add
keys qq
type Sort mail /
keys INB <Enter>
see Quick Add → INBOX
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Old item
	- Sort mail
END
